  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kenya Primary Education Evaluation and Assessment Program (KPEEAP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project strengthens accountability and resilience across Kenyas Ministry of Education and relevant semi-autonomous government agencies. By improving assessment systems and enabling data-driven decision making, the project supports the Ministry of Education to boost literacy outcomes and close learning gaps. In partnership with the Ministry and other key stakeholders, our team helps ensure that more Kenyan students meet national reading benchmarks, ultimately preparing them for greater success in school and beyond while contributing to Kenyas broader development goals.</narrative>
  </description>
